  m_text: "<size=24>- 3 or more Scatters triggers Free Games.<line-height=70%>\n<size=22>
    \       - <color=yellow>3</color> Scatters triggers <color=yellow>5</color> Free
    Games.\n        - <color=yellow>4</color> Scatters triggers <color=yellow>7</color>
    Free Games.\n        - <color=yellow>5</color> Scatters triggers <color=yellow>10</color>
    Free Games.\n<line-height=10%>\n<line-height=100%><size=26>- All Wilds get locked
    and each awards <color=yellow>1</color> additional spin.\n- Wilds remain locked
    until Free Games end."
